<div class="case-study-body">
    <div class="full-width">
        <div class="section-header-container about">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h3>Robust Documentation</h3> 
            </div>
        </div>
    <p><span class="bold">Instead of vague notes, the kit uses a modular system of "stickers" and "callouts" that inherently contain:</p>
    <ul role="list">
        <li role="listitem">Links to our existing accessibility documentation</li>
        <li role="listitem">Preset accessibility traits and fields</li>
        <li role="listitem">Reduced footprint while providing ample information for engineers</li>
    </ul>
