    <div class="case-study-body">
        <div class="">
            <p><span class="section-callout">Systems Integration & Handoff</span></p>
            <p>The goal was adoption. To ensure the kit was used, we worked directly with the Design System team to ensure the kit was ingested into the core library. This meant that accessibility wasn't a "separate file" designers had to find—it was a native part of their existing Figma workflow.</p>
            <p>Below are screenshots showing the new accessibility annotation pieces being used on native screen mockups at design handoff.</p>
